    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scott, a young man from Manhattan, finally pops the question to his girlfriend... who promptly says &quot;no.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's so dejected that he accidentally drops the ring he used to propose into a storm drain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ring keeps falling deeper and deeper underground. It falls down into the sewers, then further down into... a movie theater?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, is that a jet plane? Huh? Why are we in the Old West now? What are cowboys doing underground?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out that deep below Manhattan there's an underground dungeon where America's past lives on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Scott be able to traverse it far enough to find his ring?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>America's history turned into a dungeon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This weird dungeon is a collection of the culture and memories of decades past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The golden age of cinema, the space race, the Old West...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to take a taste of America's past, UNDERGROUNDED will offer you a full-course dinner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what's your favorite decade?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get through puzzles with a trusted ally!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think America's history is too much for one shy Manhattan boy (or for an inexperienced gamer) to tackle on his own?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worry not! You have a great ally on your quest: a talkative, cheerful canary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a puzzle has got you stumped, listen to your bird friend. He might just have the hint you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/extras/e1567758a1ac9c1df99d68975d0b7552.avif?t=1749106573\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting back what you lost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scott isn't the only one who found his way into the underground dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of different people who have lost something are there to find it too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them out and maybe, just maybe, that will help Scott's life change for the better as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat enemies with retro games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right, I forgot to mention one thing. There are terrifying, powerful bosses waiting for you in the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And one more thing: Scott has a mysterious power. If he finds a retro game cabinet and plays it, strange things happen in the world around him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play several nostalgic homages to '80s arcade masterpieces to find a way to defeat those bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/extras/30883fe2952c54234f70ce003ec80367.avif?t=1749106573\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076910/extras/e5e4cac4c7f7a7dfbe7b8712748ca20d.avif?t=1749106573\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Keyboard&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm: X / Cancel: Z / Use Item: C / Change Item: Q, E / Open Menu: ESC / Call Canary: V</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;PlayStation&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm: \u2715 / Cancel: \u3007 / Use Item: \u25a2 / Change Item: L1, R1 / Open Menu: Options / Call Canary: \u25b3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;XBox&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm: A / Cancel: B / Use Item: X / Change Item: LT, RT / Open Menu: Start / Call Canary: Y</p>",
