ragraph\" >&lt;PlayStation&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm: \u2715 / Cancel: \u3007 / Use Item: \u25a2 / Change Item: L1, R1 / Open Menu: Options / Call Canary: \u25b3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;XBox&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm: A / Cancel: B / Use Item: X / Change Item: LT, RT / Open Menu: Start / Call Canary: Y</p>",
